    "description": {
      "en": "Audio Player:\n - Playlist editor (user tags, rating and genre)\n - Tag editor (user tags, rating and genre)\n - Replaygain support (MP3 only, FLAC on its way)\n - One finger control\n - Voice commands\n\nMerge your statistics with <a href=\"https://phramusca.github.io/JaMuz/\">JaMuz Desktop</a>\n - And so with all players JaMuz Desktop can merge with (Mixxx, Kodi, guayadeque,...)\n\nSync files from <a href=\"https://phramusca.github.io/JaMuz/\">JaMuz Desktop</a> over WiFi\n - Select a playlist on JaMuz Desktop, connect JaMuz Android, and wait for your files.\n\nRemote Control for <a href=\"https://phramusca.github.io/JaMuz/\">JaMuz Desktop</a>"
    },
