    "whatsNew": {
      "en": "v0.6.14\n\n- Remote control: connect to JaMuz via SSE, receive playing state and position, send play/pause/next/previous/forward/rewind/volume from buttons and swipes. Correct local/remote display and rebind on resume; switch back to local on disconnect.\n- Build: Android API 34\u219236, min 21, AGP and Gradle update, Java 21, ProGuard config.\n- Themes: multiple themes (BlueGrey, Teal, Grey, Yellow), theme selection in settings.\n- Database & scan: update DB only when file modified; update only required "
    }
